    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d249">

                <pb facs="0387" n="311" xml:id="pg311"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20/767: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cudahy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-03-22T15:00:00+01:00">March 22, 1935—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. Please refer to last sentence my telegram number 20.<anchor n="56"
                        xml:id="d249-f1"/> Beck advises that tomorrow Polish Ambassador in Berlin
                    will verbally make a statement to the German Government directing attention to
                    consequences involved in the violation of Versailles Treaty by the evils of
                    conscription. This announcement will be orally and informally and will be more
                    mild and conciliatory in tone than that which will be given to press.</p>
                <p>Foregoing repeated to Berlin.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cudahy</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
